  "text": "## Technology Stack\n\nAVENIQ utilizes proven open-source and modern enterprise technologies for SaaS platform engineering:\n\n- **Frontend & Admin UI**: React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS\n- **Backend Services**: Node.js, Express.js, TypeScript\n- **Database & Data Store**: PostgreSQL, Supabase (with Row-Level Security), Redis\n- **Authentication**: Supabase Auth, NextAuth, OAuth 2.0, JWT\n- **Payments & Billing**: Stripe Billing, Webhooks API\n- **Infrastructure & Containerization**: Docker, Cloudflare, Linux VPS, GitHub Actions CI/CD\n\n---",
